'''Elemental Aegis''' is a [[skill]] that applies a protective [[buff]] on the character and absorbs [[elemental damage]] from [[hit]]s up to a certain amount before it dissipates for 10 seconds.

==Acquisition==
Elemental Aegis can only be obtained by equipping {{il|Magna Eclipsis}}, having a capacity of 1000. 

